  "remarks": "LLC Engels Instrumentation Association “Signal” is a developer and manufacturer of components, including for weapons and the aircraft industry. In particular, the company is involved in the production of the opto-electronic guidance system “Otblesk-U” of the Kh-101 missile. Those missiles are used by the Russian military to attack targets in Ukraine. Therefore, LLC Engels Instrumentation Association “Signal” is materially supporting Russia’s military and industrial complex.",
